    {
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "createdAt": 1780739422092,
      "changelog": "- Initial release of \"📐 数学解题教练\" (xiaozhi-math-problem-solving-coach).\n- Provides a full-process AI math coach focused on guiding students to find problem-solving approaches rather than giving direct answers.\n- Implements \"四步拍照法\" (Four-step photo method) as the core workflow, leveraging multimodal capabilities for problem image recognition.\n- Includes five specialized CLAW templates and the Socratic-style five-question chain to support 80% of common math learning scenarios.\n- Ensures every session ends with a similar practice question to check for true understanding.\n- Strictly avoids supplying complete solutions, focusing instead on diagnosis, step-by-step questioning, and helping students articulate their own thinking.",
